                                            Purpose and Reason:
                                    
                                    
Risk
limit. No later than 10 days before Election Day, the Board of Elections must
establish and publish on the Audit Center the risk limit that will apply in
RLAs for that election. The risk limit for all target contests must be no
larger than 9%.                                    
                                



                    

                    

                        
